{"path":".agents/skills/vitadeck-smoke/SKILL.md","ref":"538d2833a7caafed2a5042946bfa378f95553eb0","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":1,"text":"---"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":2,"text":"name: vitadeck-smoke"},{"sha":"538d2833a7caafed2a5042946bfa378f95553eb0","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792999920,"line":3,"text":"description: Run VitaDeck's Dockerized Linux smoke test or refresh its CI golden screenshots. Use when changing rendering, theme, fonts, the demo Deck App, or when CI smoke fails."},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":4,"text":"metadata:"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":5,"text":"  internal: true"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":6,"text":"---"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":7,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":8,"text":"# VitaDeck smoke"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":9,"text":""},{"sha":"538d2833a7caafed2a5042946bfa378f95553eb0","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792999920,"line":10,"text":"The smoke harness boots the demo Deck App (`js/examples/demo`), presses R through every section, then presses its \"Throw an error\" Button, comparing a screenshot of each page against `tests/fixtures/golden/Linux/`. `tests/fixtures/demo_stubs.js` is prepended to the demo bundle to pin `Date`, `getTime()` and `fetch`, so the Timers and fetch pages are stable."},{"sha":"538d2833a7caafed2a5042946bfa378f95553eb0","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792999920,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"99ed6cbb23775e678d737370eaaac58674735244","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238999,"line":12,"text":"The Linux smoke path is single-source: local runs and GitHub Actions both use `scripts/smoke-docker.sh` against the `smoke` stage from `Dockerfile`. CI builds that stage with BuildKit's GitHub Actions cache, then runs the script with `VITADECK_SMOKE_NO_BUILD=1`."},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":14,"text":"## Test"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":15,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":16,"text":"From the repo root:"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":17,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":18,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":19,"text":"scripts/smoke-docker.sh test"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":20,"text":"```"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":21,"text":""},{"sha":"538d2833a7caafed2a5042946bfa378f95553eb0","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792999920,"line":22,"text":"Completion criterion: the script finishes with `ctest` passing and leaves the screenshots at `out-smoke/smoke-screenshots/`."},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":23,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":24,"text":"## Update Golden"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":25,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":26,"text":"After intentional visual changes:"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":27,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":28,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":29,"text":"scripts/smoke-docker.sh update-golden"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":30,"text":"```"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":31,"text":""},{"sha":"538d2833a7caafed2a5042946bfa378f95553eb0","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792999920,"line":32,"text":"Completion criterion: `tests/fixtures/golden/Linux/` is rewritten by the Dockerized Linux harness. Review the changed PNGs before committing. A new or renamed demo section also needs its entry in `PAGES` in `tests/smoke_harness.c`."},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":33,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":34,"text":"## Notes"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":35,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":36,"text":"- The script keeps Linux `node_modules` and the pnpm store in Docker volumes, so it does not replace the host install."},{"sha":"99ed6cbb23775e678d737370eaaac58674735244","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238999,"line":37,"text":"- Use `VITADECK_SMOKE_NO_BUILD=1` only after a separate cached image build has loaded `vitadeck-smoke:latest`."}]}
